Study what this page demonstrates: a sticky positioned header, a 12-column content grid that collapses on mobile, a sidebar that becomes sticky only on <code>md:</code> screens, a card grid that scales 1 → 2 → 3 columns, show/hide helpers, and full dark-mode coverage through <code>dark:</code> variants. Every class above exists in the v3.1 catalog.

