=== 5.5 Skeletons (Loading States) ===

Shimmer placeholders for content that has not loaded yet. All three run the built-in <code>shimmer</code> keyframe animation (<code>background-position</code> sweep, 1.5s linear infinite).

<syntaxhighlight lang="html">
<div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 flex items-start gap-4">
  <div class="skeleton-circle w-12 h-12 shrink-0"></div>
  <div class="flex-1 space-y-2 py-1">
    <div class="skeleton-text w-3/4"></div>
    <div class="skeleton-text w-1/2"></div>
    <div class="skeleton-text w-5/6"></div>
  </div>
</div>
</syntaxhighlight>

{| class="wikitable"
! Class !! Effect
|-
| <code>.skeleton-rect</code> || Rounded-rectangle shimmer — set <code>w-*</code> / <code>h-*</code> on the element
|-
| <code>.skeleton-circle</code> || Circular shimmer for avatars (<code>border-radius: 9999px</code>)
|-
| <code>.skeleton-text</code> || Text-line shimmer with <code>height: 1em</code>, so it matches surrounding type size
|}

