|-
| Responsive grid || <code>grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6</code>
|-
| Show / hide by screen || <code>hidden md:block</code>, <code>max-md:hidden</code>
|-
| Dark mode || <code>&lt;html class="dark"&gt;</code> + <code>dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-white</code>
|-
| Sticky header || <code>sticky top-0 z-50</code>
|-
| Truncate text || <code>truncate</code>
|-
| Loading state || <code>skeleton-text</code> / <code>skeleton-circle</code>
|-
| Gradient text || <code>gradient-text</code>
|-
